 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "An expert in the law stood up to test him in the crowd",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teacher, which is the greatest commandment, he asked aloud",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus did not hesitate, his answer came out plain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave them back the ancient words they'd heard and heard again",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With all your soul, and with all your mind",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the great and first commandment",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the second is like it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You shall love your neighbor as yourself",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love him when you're rising and love him when you rest",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love him with your thinking and the heart within your chest",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the one who lives beside you and the stranger at your door",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love them like you love yourself, that's what the law is for",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
